From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 03:02:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] soc: mediatek: rearm P30E before CPU9 restore

Accept the proven primary-off and per-core-off CPU9 state, rearm
the exact P30E slot, and retain that boundary before the existing
single restore CPU_ON. Fail with zero CPU_ON calls on any error.
